    {
      "id": "github:1335844694",
      "name": "OpenActuary",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "开源保险精算建模平台，提供可视化模型构建器、项目工作区、数据连接器、编排运行与评分/部署；平台核心采用 AGPL-3.0，SDK 采用 Apache-2.0。",
      "homepage": "https://openactuary.io/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/openactuary-io/openactuary",
      "github_repository_id": 1335844694,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/openactuary-io/openactuary/license",
      "features": [
        "可视化模型构建器：拖拽 data→features→models→explainability→rating/deploy→governance 组件，并编译为可执行 Python",
        "项目工作区统一管理模型、notebook、rating plans、数据连接与治理记录",
        "数据连接器与项目内数据探查，支持数据库、API、文件及保单管理系统等来源",
        "orchestrator 负责 canvas→Python 编译与运行，独立 scoring API 提供结果/评分端点",
        "治理与合规工作流、审批记录、部署、drift 与 rate tables"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Docker Compose 全栈启动（api、worker、web、infra）",
        "hybrid 模式：基础设施运行于 Docker，API/Web/worker 本地运行",
        "no-docker 模式：使用自备的 PostgreSQL 与 Redis",
        "Kubernetes Helm charts"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Python 3.12、FastAPI、SQLAlchemy 2.0、Celery",
        "React 18、TypeScript、Vite、ReactFlow",
        "PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector、DuckDB、Redis 7、MinIO、Meilisearch",
        "Docker Compose、Kubernetes/Helm"
      ],
